It isn't want so much as need. Or, rather, what is wanted is to print
at 30 characters per second, rather than 10 or 15. LA36 DECwriter
printing did not look all that great at all.

The point of a 1 x 7 array is to save on solenoids and drive circuits,
not to allow fancier printing.

John Savard


